WEBVTT

00:07:29.748 --> 00:07:30.749
(Scissors cut)

00:07:33.134 --> 00:07:34.986
Stay to make sure ...

00:07:34.986 --> 00:07:37.222
(Scissors cut)

00:07:38.006 --> 00:07:40.158
It’s nice and even.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:42.911
Mhm.

00:07:47.265 --> 00:07:49.501
Craig Richard: Now,
if you felt deeply relaxed

00:07:49.501 --> 00:07:52.854
or maybe you felt
those special brain tingles,

00:07:52.854 --> 00:07:56.992
you might have been wondering,
“What is going on inside my brain?”

00:07:57.842 --> 00:07:59.427
Well, we wondered the same thing.

00:07:59.961 --> 00:08:03.498
I recently published
a brain scan study with Bryson Lochte